00:32:55.797 --> 00:32:56.880
AJA HAMMERLY: Smart house.

00:32:56.880 --> 00:32:58.740
There's an HTTP
endpoint that I can

00:32:58.740 --> 00:33:02.790
use to lock the doors for my
house via authentication means.

00:33:02.790 --> 00:33:05.080
There's actually multiple
