00:33:05.080 --> 00:33:09.023
But just a short version
is, I hit a specific HTTP

00:33:09.023 --> 00:33:10.440
endpoint with
specific credentials

00:33:10.440 --> 00:33:12.330
and it locks the doors.

00:33:12.330 --> 00:33:13.710
And then I can trigger that.

00:33:13.710 --> 00:33:16.840
It also triggers an event
when the doors unlock.

00:33:16.840 --> 00:33:21.960
So you then use Cloud Tasks
to add a timer to time out.

00:33:21.960 --> 00:33:25.780
And while this particular use
case is completely ridiculous,

00:33:25.780 --> 00:33:27.540
there are a lot of
use cases in business

00:33:27.540 --> 00:33:30.340
